       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where exiting a store would cause your HP display to change.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with displaying the map UI.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Movement:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where opening the menu with the PS button/Steam button/etc. while moving between areas would sometimes cause the game to become unplayable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where force-closing the game while moving between areas would sometimes corrupt the save data.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Miscellaneous:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
